 '500ms scenarios retain cutoff39s. **5s scenarios use cutoff42s**, predeclared before execution: last original deadline40.9875s plus>1s cancellation/ACK grace. Their wall guard is54s rather than51s; other guards are unchanged. Both ledgers/processes remain alive through scenario cutoff. Raw39/42s CPU/utilization/integral exposures are labeled; the audit also extracts preregistered common[0,39] quantities.\n',
