  report.append('**Unexpected valid run:**500ms WAIT block1 had U1485 (51.5625%),363 late completions and1030 processing expirations. The other four WAIT runs had U1944–1966 and5–26 late completions. All clocks, source/binary/configuration, event/accounting, service-phase, coverage and resource gates passed. Server CPU was17.38s versus16.35–16.65s in the other WAIT500ms runs, but the telemetry does not isolate a root cause. Completion/deadline boundary sensitivity and shared-host/instrumentation effects remain possible, unproven explanations. No rerun/exclusion was made. This run lowers the mean and widens the paired deadline interval; every block value and the median remain available rather than a selected four-run headline.\n')
