 report+=['## All-original outcomes and conditional timing\n','All-original partitions include every unsent original; mutually exclusive categories are independently replayed. Mean counts/run below are descriptive and may be fractional across five repetitions. Full per-run terminal categories, unknown/ACK flags and client-observed/server-authoritative states are preserved.\n']
