 report.append('Application payload ownership (Q+W and staging separately), pending/outstanding time, ledger storage estimates and process RSS are distinct quantities. Bounded queues do not prove bounded process memory. gRPC payload/wire and observed plaintext TCP-stream bytes are separate; packet/retransmission/NIC counters remain unsupported. Send and local response-writer elapsed include scheduling/serialization/instrumentation, never isolated HTTP/2 blocking. No claim of client application consumption follows successful server writes.\n')
